# Quiz Game 🎯

A simple and interactive quiz application built using HTML, CSS and JavaScript.

The app allows users to answer multiple-choice questions, track scores, compete on a leaderboard, and test themselves with different categories and difficulty levels.

---

## Features

- Multiple-choice quiz system
- Timer for every question
- Categories selection
- Difficulty modes
- Score tracking
- Progress bar
- Leaderboard using Local Storage
- Responsive design

---

## Built With

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

